  "title": {
   "en": "Fallen Contract"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "契約夫の溺愛からは逃げられない"
   },
   {
    "th": "สัญญาแปรเปลี่ยนหากหัวใจเพรียกหา"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Can't Escape the Love of My Contract Husband"
   },
   {
    "zh": "沦陷契约"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Jiang Yan was forced into an arranged marriage by her stepmother, which quickly became a trending topic online. To get out of the mess, she agreed to a contract marriage with Gu Linxiu, someone she had just met.\n\nWhat Jiang Yan thought about Gu Linxiu: wealthy, wheelchair-bound, and still mourning a lost love from his past.\n\nReality: he is rich — extremely so. His disability? Just a misunderstanding. And his \"lost love\"? She’s not dead at all. In fact, it’s her.\n\nWhen Jiang Yan saw the wall full of photos of her and Gu Linxiu from their younger years — along with secretly taken pictures of her daily life — she was completely stunned.\n\nWait… was she in the dark about their relationship this whole time and no one told her?"
  },
